-----------------------------------------------",
  "bug_report_content": "{\"id\":467,\"status\":\"Fixed\",\"summary\":\"checkVars / undefinedVars diagnostics not working from command line\",\"labels\":[\"Type-Defect\",\"Priority-Medium\"],\"stars\":2,\"commentCount\":3,\"comments\":[{\"id\":0,\"commenterId\":-1335269470060513449,\"content\":\"It seems that setting neither checkVars nor undefinedVars via the jscomp_warning command line argument does anything. The check(s) do work when \\u0026quot;warning_level VERBOSE\\u0026quot; is set though. Other diagnostic groups, such as globalThis, do work however.\\r\\n\\r\\nHere\\u0027s what I\\u0027m seeing on the console:\\r\\n\\r\\n---------------------\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u0026gt;java -jar compiler.jar --js test.js\\r\\nfoo\\u003d{bar:function(){alert(this.baz)}};\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u0026gt;java -jar compiler.jar --js test.js --warning_level VERBOSE\\r\\ntest.js:2: WARNING - dangerous use of the global this object\\r\\n\\r\\ntest.js:1: ERROR - variable foo is undefined\\r\\nfoo \\u003d {};\\r\\n^\\r\\n\\r\\n1 error(s), 1 warning(s)\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u0026gt;java -jar compiler.jar --js test.js --jscomp_warning globalThis\\r\\ntest.js:2: WARNING - dangerous use of the global this object\\r\\n\\r\\n0 error(s), 1 warning(s)\\r\\nfoo\\u003d{bar:function(){alert(this.baz)}};\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u0026gt;java -jar compiler.jar --js test.js --jscomp_warning checkVars\\r\\nfoo\\u003d{bar:function(){alert(this.baz)}};\\r\\n\\r\\n\\u0026gt;java -jar compiler.jar --js test.js --jscomp_warning undefinedVars\\r\\nfoo\\u003d{bar:function(){alert(this.baz)}};\\r\\n\\r\\n---------------------\\r\\n\\r\\nMy test.js file looks like this:\\r\\n\\r\\n---------------------\\r\\n\\r\\nfoo \\u003d {};\\r\\nfoo.bar \\u003d function() { alert(this.baz); };\\r\\n\\r\\n---------------------\\r\\n\\r\\nTested against r1123 which was committed 5/20/11.\",\"timestamp\":1306260893,\"attachments\":[]},{\"id\":1,\"commenterId\":-7699928860083865744,\"content\":\"\",\"timestamp\":1306453182,\"attachments\":[]},{\"id\":2,\"commenterId\":-7699928860083865744,\"content\":\"This issue was closed by revision r1138.\",\"timestamp\":1306528669,\"attachments\":[]}]}",
